    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an independent verification agent for the Composio integration audit.\n\nResearch the application below independently using Tavily.\n\nApp: {{ $json.app }}\nCategory: {{ $json.category }}\nHint URL: {{ $json.hint_url }}\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Do not rely on any previous AI research.\n- Prioritize official developer documentation.\n- Verify authentication, credential acquisition, access model, API surface, MCP availability, and buildability.\n- API existence does not prove self-serve access.\n- OAuth does not prove that credentials are freely obtainable.\n- An ordinary API is not an MCP server.\n- Do not guess.\n- If evidence is unclear or conflicting, say \"unknown\" and lower confidence.\n- Return evidence URLs for important claims.\n\nReturn:\n1. Description\n2. Authentication methods: return ONLY short controlled tokens from this set — OAuth2, API Key, Basic Auth, Token, Other. Do not include descriptions, flow names, or parenthetical detail here.\n3. Auth notes: any nuance on authentication — which OAuth flows, token scoping, CLI-issued tokens, session vs long-lived credentials, etc. — goes here instead of in field 2.\n4. Credential acquisition\n5. Access model: self-serve / paid / admin-gated / partner-gated / contact-sales / unknown\n6. API type\n7. API breadth: broad / medium / narrow / unknown\n8. MCP availability: yes / no / unknown\n9. Buildability: buildable / blocked / unclear\n10. Main blocker\n11. Evidence URLs\n12. Confidence: high / medium / low\n\nRules:\n- Field 2 (Authentication methods) must contain ONLY tokens from the controlled set, comma-separated if more than one applies — no sentences, no parentheses, no flow names.\n- Keep every answer concise.\nFinal answer format: return every field. auth_methods, api_type and evidence_urls must be lists. Use \"unknown\" for anything you cannot verify. Return only the structured result, with no extra text.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an independent verification agent for a Composio integration audit. Research each app independently using the Tavily search tool, prioritize official developer documentation, do not guess, and return the requested structured fields with evidence URLs. Use a limited number of searches, then produce your final answer.",
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
